            "prop": "customLinkClass",
            "part": "link",
            "replacement": "ui.link",
            "semantics": "merge",
            "note": "In 3.x it also applied to the disabled previous/next links. The deprecated prop keeps doing that; with `ui`, set both `link` and `disabledLink` to get the same result."
        },
        {
            "component": "Pagination",
            "prop": "customActiveLinkClass",
            "part": "activeLink",
            "replacement": "ui.activeLink",
            "semantics": "merge",
            "note": "`activeLink` layers on top of `link` for the current page, as before."
        },
        {
            "component": "Stats",
            "prop": "customContainerClass",
